{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43339","headline":"哭李远 · 卢尚书","name":"哭李远","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨日舟还浙水湄，今朝丹旐欲何爲。\n才收北浦一竿钓，未了西斋半局棊。\n洛下已传平子赋，临川争写谢公诗。\n不堪旧里经行处，风木萧萧邻笛悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢尚书","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}